    "text": "If the orthocentre of the triangle, whose vertices are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the quadratic equation whose roots are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, is",
